cuems-utils (0.1.0rc17) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Merge main into debian/bookworm (0.1.0rc17, 869fhjdq5, PR #19):
    script.xsd ActionType gains stop_project, the first project-scope
    action and the authored end of an unattended show (cuems-engine
    stop_project ActionCue). Its action_target is written empty and parses
    to None; the ActionCue constructor and setter still refuse None.
  * Every box of a cluster needs >= 0.1.0rc17 before a project carrying
    the cue is saved: older utils reject it at validation. A downgrade
    strands such a project until the cue is removed from cue_script.xml.

