cuems-utils (0.1.0rc16+1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * packaging: stop shipping /usr/lib/cuems/CACHEDIR.TAG. The 0.1.0rc16 build
    picked it up from virtualenv, and cuems-editor 0.1.0rc1-5 and
    cuems-engine 0.1.0rc4/rc5 ship the same path, so installing one over the
    other failed with "trying to overwrite" unless forced. Nothing reads it
    at runtime. Same fix as cuems-power-bridge 0.3.0-8.
  * No code change from 0.1.0rc16 (cuemsutils 0.1.0rc16 on PyPI).

